  "grounds": {
    "$about": "The person's color, chosen in Settings and stored in profiles. A mark, never a ground (DESIGN C3-C5): what still needs a memo, and the values they name. The same bright value in light and dark; ink text on it. Checked against 4,160 brands: no brand pairs any of them with sanguine.",
